'''Hard Mode? Completed It''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Theatre of Blood/Hard Mode|Theatre of Blood: Hard Mode]] within the challenge time.

== Strategy ==
Completing the raid in the challenge time is easiest in a group of 4 or 5. Time between the rooms is also counted, so players should avoid spending too much time waiting on teammates and buying supplies. 
